+</nav>
+
+  <main class="page">
+    <a href="dashboard.html" class="back-link">← Back to dashboard</a>
+
+    <section class="seo-panel">
+      <div class="seo-kicker">Built for structured research</div>
+      <h1>Research Assistant for Organized Research and Faster Breakdowns</h1>
+
+      <p>
+        This research assistant helps you break down topics, organize ideas, and get clearer research output faster.
+        It works well for general research, study help, issue spotting, note organization, and structured topic breakdowns.
+      </p>
+
+      <ul>
+        <li>Break down complex topics into clearer sections</li>
+        <li>Organize notes and research ideas faster</li>
+        <li>Get cleaner explanations and structured output</li>
+        <li>Use different research modes based on your goal</li>
