+      <ul>
+        <li>Breaking down broad topics into clearer sections</li>
+        <li>Organizing notes into a more structured format</li>
+        <li>Getting faster explanations of complex ideas</li>
+        <li>Spotting issues or angles worth exploring further</li>
+        <li>Creating a stronger starting point before deeper research</li>
+      </ul>
+
+      <h3>Why this page exists</h3>
+      <p>
+        The Research Assistant page is designed to help users move from a rough topic or question to clearer structure faster.
+        It combines a practical AI research tool with a simple workflow so users can understand topics better and organize information with less friction.
